# HMG FINAL FIX v5
# 1. Reliable collapsible section (explicit height, always responds)
# 2. Strict header rebuild — exactly one header survives
# 3. Drug list integrity — always visible, always all items
# 4. Diagnostics for toggle + header + drug count
